# Android app scaffold (updated)

This Android scaffold contains a minimal Jetpack Compose app with a Home screen (tiles) and a simple SignaturePad composable.

Next steps to run locally:
1. Open `android-app` in Android Studio.
2. Add your `google-services.json` at `android-app/app/google-services.json`.
3. Sync Gradle, build and run on a device or emulator.

Planned work I will add next after you confirm:
- Firebase Authentication (Phone + OTP) integration
- Firestore data access layer and repository classes
- Masjid registration flow (UPI intent + UTR) and Masjid dashboard
- Nikah registration form, signature capture upload to Firebase Storage
- Donations / Jobs / Matrimony / Zakat listings and CRUD flows

If you want a debug APK built and uploaded to Releases, say "Build APK" once google-services.json is present in the repo.
